SCOPE

One directory is deliberately excluded from the terms above:

  docs/opensource/cybersygn-detect/

That directory contains a standalone snapshot of an earlier version of the
field-detection module, and it carries its own MIT licence in
docs/opensource/cybersygn-detect/LICENSE. The MIT grant applies to the
contents of that directory only. It does not extend to worker/src/detect.js
or any other file in this repository, which have diverged from that snapshot
and remain proprietary under the terms above. As of this writing the snapshot
has not been published to any package registry.

